\title{Tekenverloop van een lineaire functie}
\language{nl}
\range{-5..5}
\author{Véronique Royer}
\email{royer.veronique@wanadoo.fr}
\computeanswer{no}
\format{html}
\precision{100}

\integer{a = (-1)^random(0,1)*random(1..4)}
\integer{b = (-1)^random(0,1)*random(1..10)}
\rational{zero=-\b/\a}
\function{u=\a *x + \b}
\function{u=\a==1?x + \b}
\function{u=\a==-1?-x + \b}

\rational{rep1=-\b/\a}
\text{signes1=-,+}
\text{signes2=-,+}
\text{chges=0,||,|}
\text{rep2=\a>0?1:2}
\text{rep4=\a>0?2:1}
\text{rep3=1}

\statement{
<p> Bepaal het tekenverloop van \(f) gedefinieerd op \RR door \(f(x) = \u). </p>
<p align="center">
<table border=1 border="solid" width="60%">
<tr>
<td width="10%" align="center"> \(x)</td><td  width="30%" align="left">\(-\infty)</td><td  width="5%" align="center">\embed{reply1,5}</td>
<td width="30%" align="right">\(+\infty)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="10%" align="center">\(f(x))</td><td width="30%" align="center"> \embed{reply2} </td><td  width="5%" align="center">\embed{reply3}</td><td width="30%" align="center"> \embed{reply4}</td>
</tr>
</table>
</p>
}
\answer{}{\rep1}{type=rational}
\answer{}{\rep2 ; \signes1}{type=menu}
\answer{}{\rep3 ; \chges}{type=menu}
\answer{}{\rep4 ; \signes2}{type=menu}
\hint{
<p>De functie \(ax+b)  wordt 0 in \(-\frac{b}{a}) en verandert van teken in \(-\frac{b}{a}).<br>
En heeft het teken van \(a) wanneer \(x > -\frac{b}{a}). </p>
}